   [2m└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[0m

   That is the whole loop. To land a change:

   [2m1. [0mRun the checks:
   [2m   ┌ sh ───────────┐[0m
   [2m   │[0m   bun quality [2m│[0m
   [2m   └───────────────┘[0m
   [2m2. [0mCommit on main once every check has passed and the tree is clean, so
   [2m   [0mwhoever picks the work up next starts from a build that runs.

   Then build the binary with:

   [2m┌ sh ───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[0m
 [2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[0m
